conducteo (5.0.1-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release.
    - Remove Boost dependency: use internal implementation.
    - Remove Eigen source code: use system library
    - Remove libdxf source code: use system library
    - Use english as default language for Linux
    - Install doc into /usr/share/doc/conducteo
      (runtime docs are installed into /usr/share/conducteo/docs)
    - Change icon set to open source MIT license

  * Initial release. (Closes: #1135142)

